      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "kevin@KevinPC:~/tmp/MyCalc$ make\nBuilding MyCalc with current config...\nmake -f scripts/build.mk\nmake[1]: Entering directory '/home/kevin/tmp/MyCalc'\ngcc -Wall -O2 -Iinclude -Iinclude/generated -o mycalc src/main.o\n/usr/bin/ld:src/main.o: file format not recognized; treating as linker script\n/usr/bin/ld:src/main.o:48: syntax error\ncollect2: error: ld returned 1 exit status\nmake[1]: *** [scripts/build.mk:12: mycalc] Error 1\nmake[1]: Leaving directory '/home/kevin/tmp/MyCalc'\nmake: *** [Makefile:12: all] Error 2",
